  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A secondment
Associate Director Economic Governance within the department for Competitiveness, Governance and 
Political Affairs (CGPA) which is part of Policy Strategy and Delivery (PSD) Department.
CGPA works to maintain sound economic governance in its partner countries by supporting 
structural reforms that deal with the obstacles that exist to growth and thereby increase competitiveness and enable investment.A second ring which
Associate Director Economic Governance within the department for Competitiveness, Governance and 
Political Affairs (CGPA) which is part of Policy Strategy and Delivery (PSD) Department under Vice 
Presidency of Policy and Partnerships (VP3).
CGPA works to maintain sound economic governance in its partner countries by supporting 
structural reforms that deal with the obstacles that exist to growth and thereby increase competitiveness and enable investment.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En sekundering som
Associate Director Economic Governance inom avdelningen f&#xf6;r Competitiveness, Governance and 
Political Affairs (CGPA) som &#xe4;r en del av Policy Strategy and Delivery (PSD) Department.
CGPA arbetar med att uppr&#xe4;tth&#xe5;lla en sund ekonomisk styrning i sina partnerl&#xe4;nders genom att st&#xf6;dja 
strukturella reformer som hanterar de hinder som finns f&#xf6;r tillv&#xe4;xt och d&#xe4;rmed &#xf6;kar konkurrenskraften och m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;r investeringar.</narrative>
  </description>
